On the edge of the road.

258
00:20:15,620 --> 00:20:18,000
I want to convey my thoughts?

259
00:20:18,880 --> 00:20:21,717
How much can I tell you?

260
00:20:21,800 --> 00:20:25,097
I will always be able to make sure.

261
00:20:25,180 --> 00:20:31,657
I don't know how long you are?

262
00:20:31,740 --> 00:20:34,097
I don't think you're going to

263
00:20:34,180 --> 00:20:40,160
be able to do anything else.

264
00:20:42,540 --> 00:20:49,280
I can't see you in your eyes.

265
00:21:49,280 --> 00:21:50,717
It's too bad they're almost gone.

266
00:21:50,800 --> 00:21:51,630
Oh, please.

267
00:21:51,713 --> 00:21:53,677
There's plenty left, you spoilsport.

268
00:21:53,760 --> 00:21:55,407
Anyway, we're here with Yui.

269
00:21:55,640 --> 00:21:56,937
That's the important thing.

270
00:21:57,020 --> 00:21:59,737
I still can't believe we
made it happen that fast.

271
00:21:59,820 --> 00:22:01,617
Thank you so much for this, Daddy.

272
00:22:01,700 --> 00:22:03,160
Yeah, Kirito. Thank you.

273
00:22:03,680 --> 00:22:04,510
Nah.

274
00:22:04,593 --> 00:22:08,281
If you want to thank someone, thank
Yuki for helping me develop it.

275
00:22:12,160 --> 00:22:12,990
Wow!

276
00:22:15,700 --> 00:22:17,580
The real world and the virtual.

277
00:22:18,140 --> 00:22:22,375
I thought the closer they came together,
the better the future would be.

278
00:22:23,200 --> 00:22:26,494
It's like, the more the lines
between these worlds blur,

279
00:22:26,840 --> 00:22:29,664
the more everyone gets
sucked into its darkness.

280
00:22:30,080 --> 00:22:33,480
Yeah, but a lot of people
have been helped by it, too.

281
00:22:34,740 --> 00:22:38,340
If anything, I wish I knew
what Kayaba's master plan was.

282
00:22:39,060 --> 00:22:40,000
I don't know.

283
00:22:40,280 --> 00:22:43,480
Maybe it's our job as
survivors of SAO to find out.

284
00:22:43,700 --> 00:22:45,860
I think you're overthinking things.

285
00:22:46,120 --> 00:22:47,180
Yeah, I guess.

286
00:22:47,660 --> 00:22:50,360
Still, I want to find
out more than ever now.

287
00:22:50,880 --> 00:22:54,877
Even after everything that's happened,
my curiosity's got me hooked.

288
00:22:54,960 --> 00:22:57,877
Although, a part of me
thinks I'm being played here.

289
00:22:57,960 --> 00:22:59,372
That's kind of annoying.

290
00:23:00,500 --> 00:23:01,330
Whatever.

291
00:23:01,860 --> 00:23:04,507
I don't know what's
going to happen tomorrow.

292
00:23:04,660 --> 00:23:08,360
All I know is, I want
to be with you forever.

293
00:23:08,740 --> 00:23:10,446
And I want you to be with me.

294
00:23:11,080 --> 00:23:14,497
I'll stick by you even if you
move halfway across the planet.

295
00:23:14,580 --> 00:23:16,404
Who said anything about moving?

296
00:23:17,040 --> 00:23:18,569
Don't forget to take Mila!

297
00:23:20,180 --> 00:23:21,420
Hey, lovebirds!

298
00:23:21,960 --> 00:23:23,120
Quit making out!

299
00:23:23,240 --> 00:23:24,652
We want to take a photo!

300
00:23:24,960 --> 00:23:26,360
Get over here, guys!

301
00:23:27,100 --> 00:23:28,240
Come on!

302
00:23:28,800 --> 00:23:31,980
Well, shall we? Mm-hmm. Okay, Daddy!
